    "### Attention Maps\n",
    "\n",
    "- Auxiliary model to extract attention (class/angle/energy heads).\n",
    "- Average attention heatmaps with padding masks.\n"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "id": "b8962af4",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
