      "2026-06-08 02:05:20,295  DEBUG     findfont: score(FontEntry(fname='C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts\\\\GILLUBCD.TTF', name='Gill Sans Ultra Bold Condensed', style='normal', variant='normal', weight=400, stretch='condensed', size='scalable')) = 10.25\n",
