      "2026-06-08 02:05:20,308  DEBUG     findfont: score(FontEntry(fname='C:\\\\Windows\\\\Fonts\\\\msyhbd.ttc', name='Microsoft YaHei', style='normal', variant='normal', weight=700, stretch='normal', size='scalable')) = 10.335\n",
