      "2026-06-08 02:05:56,749  INFO      ✓ Guardado: d:\\OneDrive - Universidad Técnica Federico Santa María\\CONDOR_OD\\Tesis\\CONDOR_MCDropout_XAI\\pipeline_artifacts\\diagnostics\\cnn_embedding_analysis.png\n"
