      "2026-06-08 02:06:02,700  INFO      ✓ Guardado: d:\\OneDrive - Universidad Técnica Federico Santa María\\CONDOR_OD\\Tesis\\CONDOR_MCDropout_XAI\\pipeline_artifacts\\diagnostics\\topk_attention_hits_particle.csv\n"
